                                                "sense_id": "0fc1c7df-02e2-3b4c-afed-4d8b395988e0",
                                                "text": "So strange is the scripture of the sky! Innumerable legends and customs connect the rebirth of the Sun with a Virgin parturition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47ba6b1b-0e14-414f-8c31-d84370854b05",
                                                "sense_id": "0fc1c7df-02e2-3b4c-afed-4d8b395988e0",
                                                "text": "femoules emaciated by parturition"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e088ef0a-a217-473f-8fe6-fb5c183067a8",
